{
    "slug": "apppress/reviews",
    "name": "AppPress Reviews",
    "version": "1.1.4",
    "author": "AppPress",
    "description": "Polymorphic text-and-star reviews for any reviewable subject (products, pages, events). Features a moderation queue dual-mounted in both Studio and the App-context (approve/reject/pin/verify, bulk actions, owner-reply compose form), an accessible public embed (keyboard-operable star-rating widget honoring a configurable min/max scale, helpful/not-helpful votes, sort/filter/pagination, rating-distribution bars), cached rating summaries, a generic verified-review integration hook any commerce/enrollment plugin can call, a member My Reviews panel, mobile FormScreen/ListScreen surfaces, workflow triggers/actions, and outbound webhooks. Implements StandardContracts::REVIEWS for cross-plugin submission without tight coupling.",
